 Fixed several pre-existing test failures, some surfaced by today's other work, some independently pre-existing:
 
 1. packages/cli/sandpiper_resources.test.ts and packages/cli/standalone_bootstrap.test.ts asserted shell_relay tool presence / a bundled shell-integration symlink -- both stale since shell-relay was deliberately (if temporarily) disabled in df04a14d. Updated to assert its absence instead of restoring it.
 
-2. Fixing #1 exposed a real test-isolation bug: sandpiper_resources.test.ts's remaining assertion imported the real, unmocked web-search extension, whose adapter-selection resolves the Brave API key via readSettingsKey -- reading this developer's actual ~/.sandpiper/agent/settings.json, which configures the key via , executing a real 1Password CLI shell-out with an unbounded wait for manual approval. extensions/web-search/src/adapter-selection.test.ts already has the correct pattern for this (mock readSettingsKey); applied the same vi.mock to sandpiper_resources.test.ts so it never touches real user config or invokes 1Password.
